  "notes": "{縁|ふち} (edge, rim) + ⟦{取|と}る→取る：00565_toru⟧.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {縁取|ふちど}り: border, trim, outline (noun)\n- ⟦{黒|くろ}→黒：02205_kuro⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{縁取|ふちど}る: to outline in black\n- ⟦{文字|もじ}→文字：03632_moji⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{縁取|ふちど}る: to outline letters\n- 〜⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{縁取|ふちど}られる: to be framed by",
